\u2013 Find events that match your interests with our intuitive search and filtering options.\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-square-full\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"72c5414\"},{\"text\":\"Event Creation & Management \\u2013 Organizers can effortlessly create, edit, and promote events to reach a broader audience.\",\"selected_icon\":{\"value\":\"fas fa-square-full\",\"library\":\"fa-solid\"},\"_id\":\"ce5347f\"}],\"space_between\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":25,\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_align\":\"left\",\"icon_color\":\"#467FF7\",\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"4\",\"sizes\":[]},\"text_color\":\"#1C244B\",\"text_indent\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"9\",\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"icon_typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"icon_typography_font_weight\":\"300\",\"icon_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"16\",\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_typography_text_transform\":\"capitalize\",\"icon_typography_font_style\":\"normal\",\"icon_typography_text_decoration\":\"none\",\"icon_typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"1.5\",\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_typography_line_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"0\",\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"0\",\"sizes\":[]},\"icon_typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":14,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"icon-list\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"7518313\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_column_size\":\"50\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"5\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"width_tablet\":{\"size\":\"100\",\"unit\":\"%\"},\"margin_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":\"1\"},\"padding_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":\"\"},\"width\":{\"size\":40,\"unit\":\"%\"},\"flex_gap\":{\"size\":\"15\",\"unit\":\"px\",\"column\":\"15\",\"row\":\"15\",\"isLinked\":true},\"padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":\"\"},\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"column\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8265466\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"What We Offer\",\"align_mobile\":\"center\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"title_color\":\"#1C244B\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"65\",\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"45\",\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"28\",\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"600\",\"typography_text_transform\":\"none\",\"typography_font_style\":\"normal\",\"typography_text_decoration\":\"none\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"1.2\",\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_line_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"1.1\",\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_letter_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":\"0\",\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_word_spacing\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":\"0\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"94a006c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>As a dedicated member of the Salem State University community, I created Salem Events Hub: Discover Local Happenings to make event discovery effortless and enjoyable for everyone. Whether you\'re a student looking for new opportunities, a faculty member sharing academic events, or an organizer promoting a special gathering, this platform was designed with you in mind.<\\/p>\",\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"\",\"right\":\"\",\"bottom\":\"\",\"left\":\"\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_padding_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"